        "original_id": "37c964c9-0aee-5f36-b083-d325690dd731",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Jesus Jones, The 77s\n- Places: Bradford-on-Avon, Wiltshire\n- People: Michael Roe, Mark Harmon, Bruce Spencer\n- Topics: alternative rock, rock music\n\nFacts:\n- Jesus Jones are a British alternative rock band from Bradford-on-Avon in Wiltshire.\n- Jesus Jones formed in late 1988.\n- Jesus Jones recorded and performed from the late 1980s into the 2000s.\n- The 77s are an American rock band.\n- The 77s are also spelled The Seventy Sevens and The 77's.\n- Michael Roe performed vocals and guitar in The 77s.\n- Mark Harmon played bass in The 77s.\n- Bruce Spencer played drums in The 77s.",
